---
// BeP02CaseLifecycle: added in the figure pass. Red = the part the reader owns or the failing path.
---
<figure class="bep2m">
  <div class="bep2m-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 282" role="img" aria-label="Timeline of case 13: POST answers 201 Created with a Location header, GET answers 200 with the case, PUT answers 200 and changes priority from high to low, DELETE answers 204 with an empty body, and the next GET answers 404 case not found. The URL outlives the data.">
<text x="20" y="22" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>the life of case 13, as the server log saw it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vòng đời của vụ 13, như server log đã thấy</tspan></text>
<rect x="90" y="132" width="540" height="12" rx="6" class="band" />
<path d="M 636 138 L 810 138" class="ln d" />
<text x="360" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>case 13 exists</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vụ 13 đang tồn tại</tspan></text>
<text x="724" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>the URL still names it — nothing behind it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>URL vẫn gọi tên nó — nhưng không còn gì</tspan></text>
<circle cx="90" cy="138" r="9" class="dot" />
<text x="90" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>POST /v1/cases</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>POST /v1/cases</tspan></text>
<line x1="90" y1="106" x2="90" y2="127" class="ln d" />
<circle cx="270" cy="138" r="9" class="dot" />
<text x="270" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>GET /v1/cases/13</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GET /v1/cases/13</tspan></text>
<line x1="270" y1="106" x2="270" y2="127" class="ln d" />
<circle cx="450" cy="138" r="9" class="dot" />
<text x="450" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>PUT /v1/cases/13</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>PUT /v1/cases/13</tspan></text>
<line x1="450" y1="106" x2="450" y2="127" class="ln d" />
<circle cx="630" cy="138" r="9" class="dot" />
<text x="630" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>DELETE /v1/cases/13</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>DELETE /v1/cases/13</tspan></text>
<line x1="630" y1="106" x2="630" y2="127" class="ln d" />
<circle cx="810" cy="138" r="9" class="dot" />
<text x="810" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>GET /v1/cases/13</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GET /v1/cases/13</tspan></text>
<line x1="810" y1="106" x2="810" y2="127" class="ln d" />
<rect x="6" y="196" width="168" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="90" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>201 Created</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>201 Created</tspan></text>
<text x="90" y="244" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Location: /v1/cases/13</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Location: /v1/cases/13</tspan></text>
<rect x="186" y="196" width="168" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="270" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>200 OK</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>200 OK</tspan></text>
<text x="270" y="244" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>the case itself</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chính vụ việc</tspan></text>
<rect x="366" y="196" width="168" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="450" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>200 OK</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>200 OK</tspan></text>
<text x="450" y="244" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>priority high → low</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>priority high → low</tspan></text>
<rect x="546" y="196" width="168" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="630" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>204 No Content</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>204 No Content</tspan></text>
<text x="630" y="244" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>empty body</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>body rỗng</tspan></text>
<rect x="726" y="196" width="168" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="810" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>404 Not Found</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>404 Not Found</tspan></text>
<text x="810" y="244" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>case not found</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>case not found</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Five requests, one URL, and the receipt each one returns. Read left to right, this is the whole section in one line.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Năm request, một URL, và biên lai mỗi request trả về. Đọc từ trái sang phải, đây là cả mục này trong một dòng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep2m { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep2m-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep2m svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep2m text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep2m .tt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep2m .b { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep2m .bb { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2m .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep2m .f { fill: var(--text-faint); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep2m .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2m .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2m .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2m .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2m .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2m .d { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep2m .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2m .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2m .xr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2m .ok { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2m .band { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2m .bandr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2m .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2m .dotr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2m figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
